        "original_id": "1930c340-9b36-55de-97fd-b80b3359cad5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jason Schwartzman, Wes Anderson, Ben Stiller, Anna Kendrick, Roald Dahl, King Naresuan\n- Films: Fantastic Mr. Fox, Khan Kluay, Rushmore, The Darjeeling Limited, Moonrise Kingdom, The Grand Budapest Hotel, The Marc Pease Experience\n- Topics: animation, comedy films, literary adaptation, Ayutthaya-era Siam, film collaborations\n\nFacts:\n- Jason Schwartzman collaborated with Wes Anderson on the films Rushmore in 1998, The Darjeeling Limited in 2007, Fantastic Mr. Fox in 2009, Moonrise Kingdom in 2012, and The Grand Budapest Hotel in 2014.\n- Khan Kluay is a 2006 Thai 3D computer-animated action adventure comedy family feature film set during Ayutthaya-era Siam.\n- Khan Kluay follows a Thai elephant that wanders away from his mother and eventually becomes the war elephant for King Naresuan.\n- Fantastic Mr. Fox is a 2009 American stop-motion animated comedy film based on Roald Dahl's children's novel of the same name.\n- The Marc Pease Experience stars Jason Schwartzman as Pease, Ben Stiller as Marc's former mentor, and Anna Kendrick as his love interest.",
